---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="DSpace 9.x Core Migration">
    <div class="project-detail-container">
        <a href="/en/#projects" class="back-link"> Back to Log</a>
        
        <div class="project-header-title">
            <h1>DSpace 9.x Core Migration <span class="tag-title">[ 01 // INFRASTRUCTURE 📁 ]</span></h1>
            <p class="about-subtitle">AREA: INFRASTRUCTURE // ROLE: IT Support Assistant (DTES) // STACK: Solr, DSpace, Linux, Bash, PostgreSQL</p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-card-split">
            <div class="about-content-box">
                <p>Migration, update, and integration of the <a href="http://saber.ula.ve/" target="_blank" class="text-link">SaberULA Institutional Repository</a> for Universidad de Los Andes, transitioning from legacy architectures (DSpace 6.x) to modern standards (<a href="https://dspace.lyrasis.org/" target="_blank" class="text-link">DSpace 9.x</a> / REST API) under strict confidentiality guidelines.</p>
                
                <h3 class="points-title">~ Key Work Points</h3>
                <ul class="project-points">
                    <li><strong>[ Data Migration ]</strong> Schema updates and secure transfer of metadata, digital objects (Assetstore), and configurations with zero data loss.</li>
                    <li><strong>[ Apache Solr ]</strong> Reindexing of usage statistics cores and historical queries to ensure the continuity of the repository's history.</li>
                    <li><strong>[ Automation ]</strong> Design and execution of Bash scripts to optimize data ingestion, PostgreSQL consistency audits, and system tasks.</li>
                </ul>
                
                <div class="about-skills">
                    <span>[ DSpace 9.x ]</span>
                    <span>[ PostgreSQL ]</span>
                    <span>[ Apache Solr ]</span>
                    <span>[ Bash Scripting ]</span>
                    <span>[ REST API ]</span>
                </div>

                <div class="social-links-cozy">
                    <a href="http://saber.ula.ve/" target="_blank" class="btn-cozy">[ Visit SaberULA ↗ ]</a>
                    <a href="https://dspace.lyrasis.org/" target="_blank" class="btn-cozy">[ DSpace Official ↗ ]</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="about-image-box">
                <img src="/images/dspace.jpg" alt="DSpace 9.x migration project illustration" class="cozy-illustration-img" />
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</Layout>